-9wKI7XK9s_K0NzSp3U9yuwz7c1dP_g1ScYQjgKuuCBM0mO2mueUkiZWzj2EHZk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTQTUN_5sTfwZMT94HC91jKNnXp3F-UTEv9_qbiKmt4CA&oe=6AFF10FB"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "1140112234513126", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982696_1140112237846459_3391350817744798822_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ucb33QgpXnIQ7kNvwHvgLpJ&_nc_oc=AdoCm5w4gr0TUzgEiT2WMQBvYFq_Yvqg0t2nlrzF-1fOMuUndxSWSr0o_tZs7s8wUlM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSc-FsFtZ31yUGi34Do0wm2rgJk_vusO2-9YevBPb4-kw&oe=6AFF03C8"}, {"file_name": "Untitled design-12.png", "id": "1855003265306793", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031329_1855003268640126_3692145407816589862_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BDd1Np_Erg4Q7kNvwG7iAmw&_nc_oc=AdoaUdWKqNp0FbjaFOOYwhwqM_nQcNMaEDiFBMHd7GdGnrxi8bPGDAQ4aUcMG2_m_oE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRn8bHoRu-I2c8xKDodt1szcochiK_pXUbRNojSYp8x3A&oe=6AFF2E84"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 2024-09-19 at 5.04.56\u202fPM-2560x1440.png", "id": "3829319804053099", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035399_3829319807386432_8697232045329718283_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jwEmgAXCpokQ7kNvwGm8U21&_nc_oc=Adp6M2-sjeimxWtz9w1Ti1XiYRGwYUs59vFM00M_P36fgnF6L9PifM1TTazdN09eRbc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRFqYv-K__jayFRu5Nnvn21JrEkff_Pfqxrl3eiIxItNw&oe=6AFF0556"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "LangScape.png", "id": "1950772375415851", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75207242_1950772378749184_9023911922798697221_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VKWdgfnZXmgQ7kNvwExq0yM&_nc_oc=Adr-n7FX6bQHgm2wusYfbPKa9BiquiefamVvOM7xPuEZzGR3jLOYWBn8NgBBabb3dwA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTZX5BqmSlhrSYlxa3npAHmdOgtRTHXperP208eEV0DGg&oe=6AFF07A2"}, "display_name": "Retropy VR Puzzles", "keywords": ["puzzle", "puzzling", "scan", "jigsaw", "retropy"], "long_description": "\ud83e\udde9 Become a Puzzle Master. With 16 base puzzles and free monthly content, you will never run out of satisfying 3D jigsaw puzzles to complete. Ranging from easy to complex, there are a variety of themes to enjoy. \n\n{963016575775248}\n\n\ud83e\udde9 Exercise Brain Health. It's no secret that daily puzzles improve brain health. Relax in a whole new world of oddities and detailed puzzles crafted for relaxation and to improve cognitive function. \n\n{1113800780393627}\n\n\ud83e\udde9 Customize Your Puzzle Space. Enjoy detailed objects in your choice of immersive VR environments, change the music from energetic to relaxing, and make it your own!", "short_description": "Retropy VR Puzzles brings you hours of relaxing 3D jigsaw puzzles  in an immersive VR or MR space. Enjoy 16 base puzzles and 2 - 3 puzzles added each month for FREE. \n\nRanging in difficulty from Easy to Hard, adjust the challenge to your comfort and unlock achievements as you complete each puzzle. \n\nFeatures:\n16 Detailed objects to puzzle\nUnique VR environments \nA variety of music \nConstant updates and free content \n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://retropy.space/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://retropy.space/tos", "publisher_name": "Surf Punk Interactive", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://retropy.space/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO